  "selection": "Sort the 24 previously registered physical training maps by (terrain SHA,seed); take first 4 fit, next 2 held. Each existing archived candidate trajectory in both actual physical seats supplies its first 32 consecutive acting observations from step 0. Source paths, seat and map alone select a tape. Never select on command, score or outcome.",
  "scope": "Offline teacher labels on historical Sapling variants. The acting learner in each source is individually identified by SHA; these are not rollouts of the current ede48ad9 network. All six maps were already training-eligible in the parent lineage, so the held split is unseen by this corrective update only. No formal map, fresh development map, new game or scored shadow continuation.",
  "teacher_history": "Cold persistent instance per tape. Query original public agent function once per signed current own-seat observation, original T=1.0, _S_ABORT=0.58, _SEED=None, no overrides. After recording its label, call its own tracker.set_actions(observation.players, actual archived learner order) outside the public callable. Independently derive actual toroidal destinations and verify immediately and before the next call; _ST.prev must match the actual public players each step. Retain native adaptive cost and private sampling state; future native search is not treated as reproducible wall time. Official environment only advances archived orders of both sides.",
